{"id":"fatica","lemma":"fatica","pos":"noun","rank":2194,"glosses":["effort, endeavour/endeavor, work (physical or mental)","difficulty","labour/labor, toil, fatigue"],"ipa":"/faˈti.ka/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fatiche"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-fatica.wav","examples":[{"text":"Sto facendo fatica a spiegare questo.","en":"I'm having a hard time explaining this.","words":[{"g":"to stay, remain","l":"stare"},{"g":"to do","l":"fare"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to explain"},{"g":"this"}]},{"text":"Faceva fatica a respirare.","en":"He had trouble breathing.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"fare"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to breathe"}]},{"text":"Faccio fatica ad affrontare tutto questo.","en":"I'm struggling to cope with it all.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"fare"},null,null,{"g":"to face or confront"},{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"this"}]},{"text":"A gloria non si va senza fatica.","en":"No pain, no gain!","words":[{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"glory"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to go","l":"andare"},{"g":"without, -less"},null]},{"text":"Stava respirando a fatica.","en":"She was breathing hard.","words":[{"g":"to stay, remain","l":"stare"},{"g":"to breathe","l":"respirare"},{"g":"to / at"},null]}]}